# Known issues:
#   - Unit Test file: ".\unittest\Test05b.pdf"
#       This file has been updated with additional text from Adobe Pro (?)
#       It does not parse the same as files straight out of Meet Manager
#   - Session filter (-s) causes issues with merged sessions and sessions with
#     alpha characters (eg. Session 1B)
#
# Verified .xlsx output on:
#   - Office 365 Online Excel
#   - Google Sheets
#
# Handles the following cases:
#   1) One session per page
#   2) Multiple sessions per page
#   3) Session that spans more than a page
#   4) Alpha characters in session numbers (eg. 1B, 1G)
#   5) Single gender sessions
#   6) Merging of single gender sessions
#
# Planned Updates:
#   1) Need to search "GOTO"s and address
#   2) Four hour rule detector
